//
// The whole yolo26n graph on NPU2, letterboxed uint8 image to the (300, 6)
// detections, against the numpy oracle on seeded synthetic weights and
// random images (no checkpoint needed).
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
// REQUIRES: makefile_examples
//
// RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% make -f %S/Makefile BUILD=%t N=2 run_synthetic | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: yolo26n: 2/2 images PASS
